# Repository structure

Numbered domain folders `00-MASTER-MAP` … `50-CHEAT-SHEETS` plus `99-META`. Map: `00-MASTER-MAP/repository-structure.md`.

## Put things here

| Kind | Location |
|---|---|
| Scope / maps / graphs | `00-MASTER-MAP/` |
| Sources, gates, graph JSON, templates | `99-META/` |
| Domain curriculum | matching `NN-NAME/` folder |
| Executable labs | `42-CAPSTONE-PROJECTS/`, `43-EXPERIMENTS/` (from Gate 8) |
| Cursor rules | `.cursor/rules/` |
| Agent instructions | `AGENTS.md` |

## Concept template (create a file only with meaningful content)

`01-overview` through `21-cheat-sheet` — see `99-META/templates/concept.md`. Do not mechanically scaffold empty files.

## Knowledge graph

Machine-readable outline: `99-META/knowledge-graph.json`. Keep nodes/edges in sync when adding a major concept.

## HTML

Local-first static app (HTML/CSS/JS/Markdown/JSON/YAML/Mermaid). No backend unless necessary. Reader shell: `index.html`, `app/css/lab.css`, `app/js/`. Markdown is the source; generate views with `python app/tools/render-pages.py`. Browser nav must link `.html`, never raw `.md`. Do not build the full interactive app (depth selector, Why-chains, simulations) until Gate 9.

Do not rename domain folders without updating `00-MASTER-MAP/repository-structure.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and the knowledge graph.
